      "created_at": "2024-07-20T15:38:05.218Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I didn’t mean that in a boring “quantify this for me” powerscaling nonsense question. More just engaging with the metafiction, like how different writers depict it across the ages, how often writers actually remember that Single Attack Negation exists, does it come into play as a crucial point in the story often? That kind of stuff.</p>\n<p>I find they’re usually a lot more willing to engage deeply with questions about powers as a function of fiction rather than just asking them to quantify things, which is dull.</p>",
